      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=120%><align=center><color=#FFD700>H0W T0 WIN\n\n <color=#00FF00>1.
    BUILD Y0UR GRID Find Tetris bl0cks scattered acr0ss the map and bring them t0
    y0ur base. Fill y0ur 5x5 Grid t0 unl0ck the endgame. <color=#FF4500>\n\n2. SAB0TAGE
    & STEAL T0 steal a piece fr0m an 0pp0nent's grid: \u2022 Pick up weap0ns ar0und
    the map. \u2022 Eliminate the player (they respawn in 10s). \u2022 0nce killed,
    their panel is unl0cked f0r y0u! N0te: Panels have a 30s c00ld0wn after a piece
    is st0len. <color=#FFD700>\n\n3. CLAIM THE CR0WN When a grid is c0mplete, the
    Center Vault 0pens. \u2022 Every0ne is alerted! \u2022 Race t0 the middle t0
    c0llect y0ur Cr0wn. \u2022 Beware: 0thers can still kill y0u and steal pieces
    t0 reset y0ur pr0gress! <align=center><size=120%>\n\nFirst t0 the Cr0wn wins!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
